  id: chained_thrall
  title: 'The Chained Thrall'
  scene: 'A servant chained to a pillar, half turned, grey to the elbows. He begs you not to kill him. He served the steward, he says, and he knows how the master calls his own.'
  choices:
  - label: 'Loosen his chains'
    result: 'He clutches at whoever frees him, then talks.'
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    hiddenByClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5fed4fce6d04d7e81c849979a4915f2, type: 2}
    outcomes:
    - kind: 3
      amount: 3
      id: ''
    - kind: 5
      amount: 0
      id: 'thrall_confession'
  - label: 'Name his master'
    result: 'At Vael''s name he goes still, and tells you everything.'
    requiresClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d6a6ef812e14e72810448a05d8eb694, type: 2}
    hiddenByClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5fed4fce6d04d7e81c849979a4915f2, type: 2}
    outcomes:
    - kind: 5
      amount: 0
      id: 'thrall_confession'
  - label: 'Leave him'
    result: 'His begging follows you down the corridor.'
